    "detailed_description": "Bombard is a somewhat strategic block-breaking game with elemental balls and blocks, with an upgrade based progression system<br />\r\nThe more blocks you destroy, and materials you collect, the bigger and blastier the elemental effects will become.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Elemental Balls and Blocks that spawn Lightning Arcs, Fiery Explosions and Chilling Areas.<br />\r\n- Upgrade your health, aiming length, ball count, and ball effects while progressing through the Standard set of levels<br />\r\n- Challenge yourself to an Endless run of progressively beefier Blocks or Levels<br />\r\n- Prime Elemental Blocks with matching Elemental Balls for the biggest Effects",
